100 rem  exp_cmd_query_ : ask a yes/no question, return 1 (yes) or 2 (no)
110 rem  call ">udd>...>exp_cmd_query_": q$, r        (r is output)
120 rem  callers feed r into on..goto: 14070 on y goto 10870,2100
130 rem  (1=yes, 2=no).  Pure BASIC: prompt + linput, loop until valid.
140 sub "exp_cmd_query_": q$, r
150 print q$;
160 print " (yes or no)? ";
170 linput z$
180 if z$ = "yes" then 260
190 if z$ = "y" then 260
200 if z$ = "no" then 280
210 if z$ = "n" then 280
220 print "Please answer yes or no."
230 goto 150
260 let r = 1
270 goto 290
280 let r = 2
290 subend
